<title>PORTUGAL: SOCCER-PORTUGUESE FIRST DIVISION HONOURS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PORTUGUESE FIRST DIVISION HONOURS.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Honours at the end of the Portuguese first division soccer season on Sunday:</p>
<p>Champions: Porto</p>
<p>Runners Up: Sporting</p>
<p>Cup Winners' Cup: Boavista</p>
<p>UEFA Cup qualifiers: Benfica, Braga, Guimaraes</p>
<p>Relegated: Espinho, Uniao Leiria, Gil Vicente</p>
<p>Promoted: Campomaiorense, Varzim, Academica</p>
